   "_comment": "Model team rule (art/skills/ultimate_defaults.json, Boss 2026-10-08): every ultimate strikes FORWARD, 2 body lengths, never around the user. 1 body length = 1.70 m in game (the chibi's 1.5067 m without hair x its 1.128 scale), so the box runs 0.05..2 body lengths ahead (0.085..3.40 m), 1.1 wide (1.87 m), 1.0 high (1.70 m). fixed_reach: the weapon's reach/width do not change it. grow_from: the front edge travels out like the wave, from half the range to all of it over the active frames (each target is hit once). These numbers are what a weapon WITHOUT an imported skill pack uses (the fists): a weapon that has one (data/combat/ultimates.json) gets its startup/active/recovery/box/dash from the pack's own clip, and only the overrides below are kept on top.",
